      "text": "LOOK: Heavy rains brought about by Typhoon Quedan caused flooding in some areas in Bacolod City on Thursday night, Oct. 9.\n\nThe Bureau of Fire Protection (BFP)-Bacolod rescued some stranded individuals in front of a shopping mall in Barangay Mandalagan after floodwater reached 3-4 ft. \n\nThe city government reported that some residents have been evacuated, but data gathering is ongoing.| via Glazyl Masculino\n\n📷 BFP-Bacolod",
